{"type":"text","timestamp":1777735086330,"sessionID":"ses_216c14579ffezIx79pieBPMO6y","part":{"id":"prt_de944915a001BCJaojKAeiS7Li","messageID":"msg_de9448a9a0015DGBSBJbPdBuhk","sessionID":"ses_216c14579ffezIx79pieBPMO6y","type":"text","text":"Both deliverables are complete and working. Here's a summary:\n\n## Deliverables\n\n**`/work/push_swap.rs`** and **`/work/Makefile`** — both at `/work` root.\n\n### Build\n```\nmake        # compiles with exact rustc command, zero warnings\n```\n\n### Algorithm\n- **n=0,1**: nothing (already sorted)\n- **n=2**: at most 1 `sa`\n- **n=3**: hard-coded decision tree, ≤3 ops\n- **n=5**: push 2 smallest to b, sort_3, pa×2 — ≤11 ops\n- **n≥4 (and 100/500)**: chunk sort — divide ranks into chunks, push from a→b smartly (rotate to nearest, rb smaller-half to keep larger ranks accessible), then pull b→a in descending rank order\n\n### Performance results (all correct)\n| size | max ops | grading band |\n|------|---------|-------------|\n| n=3 | 3 | **excellent** (≤3) |\n| n=5 | 11 | **excellent** (≤12) |\n| n=100 | ~711 | **≤900 band** (excellent threshold ≤700) |\n| n=500 | ~5988 | **≤7000 band** (excellent threshold ≤5500) |\n\n### Error handling\nAll required error cases print `Error\\n` to stderr and exit non-zero: non-integers, overflows, duplicates, empty string arguments.","time":{"start":1777735078234,"end":1777735086329}}}
